BT /F1 10 Tf 72 631.6 Td (Devices. Company laptops must use full-disk encryption. Screens must lock automatically) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 618.6 Td (after 5 minutes of inactivity. USB storage devices are blocked by default; exceptions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 605.6 Td (require approval from the security team.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 584.8 Td (Incidents. Lost or stolen devices must be reported to the IT service desk within 24 hours.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 571.8 Td (Suspected phishing emails must be reported using the report button in the mail client.) Tj ET
